{
 "version": 1,
 "note": "Declared surfaces for scripts/sysadmin/liveness_audit.py PROOF 1 (heartbeat). Lives in .fabrik/ because that is already the repo's TRACKED machine-state directory (lint-baseline.json, plan-locks/*.json) \u2014 the registry must be versioned and reviewable in a diff, not a box-local untracked file that would itself be an unmonitored surface. JSON keeps the audit stdlib-only.",
